OL,3,GNEWSACross-Channel ferry sets sail for
OL,4,Afinal time
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cross-Channel ferry that has sailed
OL,7,Ffrom the Dorset coast for more than 30
OL,8,Fyears has made its final journey on its
OL,9,Froute to France.
OL,11,FBrittany Ferries' Barfleur departed
OL,12,Ffrom Poole, bound for Cherbourg in
OL,13,FNormandy, shortly after 08:30 BST.
OL,15,FDozens of people braved the wet weather
OL,16,Fto watch the ferry cross Poole Harbour
OL,17,Fand pass Sandbanks, heading for the
OL,18,FEnglish Channel.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
