OL,3,GNEWSACross-Channel ferry sets sail for
OL,4,Afinal time
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrittany Ferries announced earlier this
OL,7,Fyear it would sell Barfleur and end the
OL,8,Froute, which it said had seen passenger
OL,9,Fnumbers fall by 70% since 2002.
